TOW FILM LOUNGE @ STONEYDOWN PARK  </h3><h4 style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">SATURDAY 5th SEPTEMBER</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"> PRETORIA AVENUE, WALTHAMSTOW, LONDON E17 6JY </p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-418d5a4ed1f1bdd7550d {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-418d5a4ed1f1bdd7550d .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-418d5a4ed1f1bdd7550d {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-418d5a4ed1f1bdd7550d {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-418d5a4ed1f1bdd7550d {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-418d5a4ed1f1bdd7550d {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-418d5a4ed1f1bdd7550d .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/81576dee-e803-41a8-9338-bb495cc86e12_1017/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/81576dee-e803-41a8-9338-bb495cc86e12_1017/website.components.button.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.button\" data-sqsp-block=\"button\" data-website-component-id=\"2dec74e814ccfe9d80da\" id=\"block-2dec74e814ccfe9d80da\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n      \n      \n\n\n\n<div\n  class=\"sqs-block-button-container sqs-button-block-container-system_desktop sqs-block-button-container--center sqs-stretched\"\n  data-animation-role=\"button\"\n  data-button-size=\"medium\"\n  data-button-type=\"primary\"\n  \n>\n  <a\n    href=\"\"\n    class=\"sqs-block-button-element--medium sqs-button-element--primary sqs-block-button-element\"\n    data-sqsp-button\n    \n  >\n    FREE EVENT - JUST TURN UP\n  </a>\n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n    \n  \n    \n    \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n<style>\n  #block-2dec74e814ccfe9d80da {\n    --sqs-block-content-flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n    \n      \n      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n</style>\n<style class=\"transform-vars\">\n    #block-2dec74e814ccfe9d80da {\n      --opacity: 100%;\n      --translate-x: 0px;\n      --translate-y: 0px;\n      --rotation: 0deg;\n      --scale-x: 100%;\n      --scale-y: 100%;\n      --skew-x: 0deg;\n      --skew-y: 0deg;\n      --origin-x: 50%;\n      --origin-y: 50%;\n      --block-transform: none;\n\n      opacity: var(--opacity, 1);\n      transform: var(--block-transform);\n      transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y);\n    }\n  </style><style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/2328ad91-4a65-4ef8-869d-177344382b88_847/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/2328ad91-4a65-4ef8-869d-177344382b88_847/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"9bcce75c84630f93c5f5\" id=\"block-9bcce75c84630f93c5f5\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">We return to Walthamstow’s vibrant Stoneydown Park for another evening of relaxed and engaging outdoor cinema. In collaboration with Friends of the Park, this is our eighth year in this fabulous space.   </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">This classic science fiction comedy sees the scientist father of a teenage girl and boy accidentally shrinking his and two other neighbourhood teens to the size of insects. Now the teens must fight diminutive dangers as the father searches for them.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Venue:&nbsp;Stoneydown Park, Pretoria Avenue, E17 6JY</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Refreshments: Soft drinks, popcorn and other snacks. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Doors:&nbsp;Open 19:00, Film 19:45, Close 20:00</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Tickets: Free event </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Seating: Please note that temporary seating will not be available so please bring camping chairs, cushions and blankets.</p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-9bcce75c84630f93c5f5 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-9bcce75c84630f93c5f5 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-9bcce75c84630f93c5f5 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-9bcce75c84630f93c5f5 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-9bcce75c84630f93c5f5 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-9bcce75c84630f93c5f5 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-9bcce75c84630f93c5f5 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  \n  </div>\n  \n</section>\n\n      \n    \n      \n        \n        \n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<section\n  data-test=\"page-section\"\n  \n  data-section-theme=\"black\"\n  class='page-section \n    \n      layout-engine-section\n    \n    background-width--full-bleed\n    \n      section-height--medium\n    \n    \n      content-width--wide\n    \n    horizontal-alignment--center\n    vertical-alignment--middle\n    \n      \n    \n    \n    black'\n  \n  data-section-id=\"6a0dffbc048c043624aa9d7e\"\n  \n  data-controller=\"SectionWrapperController\"\n  data-current-styles=\"{\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;imageOverlayOpacity&quot;: 0.15,\n                                                                                                                            