hite-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">STOW FILM LOUNGE @            ST  MARY’S CHURCH </h3><h4 style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">SATURDAY 26th SEPTEMBER</h4><p class=\"\" style=\"text-align: center; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"> 8 CHURCH END, WALTHAMSTSOW, LONDON E17 9RJ </p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-bfdb6a484b103b568a68 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-bfdb6a484b103b568a68 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-bfdb6a484b103b568a68 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-bfdb6a484b103b568a68 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-bfdb6a484b103b568a68 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-bfdb6a484b103b568a68 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-bfdb6a484b103b568a68 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-button button-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/81576dee-e803-41a8-9338-bb495cc86e12_1017/website.components.button.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.button/81576dee-e803-41a8-9338-bb495cc86e12_1017/website.components.button.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.button\" data-sqsp-block=\"button\" data-website-component-id=\"a2bab1b57704a29c9bf3\" id=\"block-a2bab1b57704a29c9bf3\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n\n  \n    \n    \n      \n      \n\n\n\n<div\n  class=\"sqs-block-button-container sqs-button-block-container-system_desktop sqs-block-button-container--center sqs-stretched\"\n  data-animation-role=\"button\"\n  data-button-size=\"medium\"\n  data-button-type=\"primary\"\n  \n>\n  <a\n    href=\"/buytickets/p/jesuschristsuperstar\"\n    class=\"sqs-block-button-element--medium sqs-button-element--primary sqs-block-button-element\"\n    data-sqsp-button\n    target=\"_blank\"\n  >\n     BOOK NOW\n  </a>\n  \n\n\n\n</div>\n\n    \n  \n    \n    \n      \n    \n  \n\n\n<style>\n  #block-a2bab1b57704a29c9bf3 {\n    --sqs-block-content-flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  \n  \n    \n      \n      \n    \n      \n      \n        \n      \n    \n  \n</style>\n<style class=\"transform-vars\">\n    #block-a2bab1b57704a29c9bf3 {\n      --opacity: 100%;\n      --translate-x: 0px;\n      --translate-y: 0px;\n      --rotation: 0deg;\n      --scale-x: 100%;\n      --scale-y: 100%;\n      --skew-x: 0deg;\n      --skew-y: 0deg;\n      --origin-x: 50%;\n      --origin-y: 50%;\n      --block-transform: none;\n\n      opacity: var(--opacity, 1);\n      transform: var(--block-transform);\n      transform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y);\n    }\n  </style><style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/2328ad91-4a65-4ef8-869d-177344382b88_847/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/2328ad91-4a65-4ef8-869d-177344382b88_847/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"acbc46773f00fd53bf6b\" id=\"block-acbc46773f00fd53bf6b\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Following our sell-out of Metropolis with Palooka 5’s own live accompaniment, we return to this wonderful venue to screen this dazzling interpretation of Tim Rice’s &amp; Andrew Lloyd Webber’s rock opera.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">It tells the story of Christ’s final week on earth in a bold and epic production. Shot entirely on location in Israel, producer/director Norman Jewison creates a brilliant example of modern filmmaking with a ground-breaking vision and featuring, of course, the unforgettable songs.     </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Venue:&nbsp;St. Mary’s Church, 8 Church End, Walthamstow, E17 9RJ</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Refreshments:  A fully licensed bar</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Tickets: Full Price £15, Conc £10, Family Ticket 2x Adults &amp; 2x Under 16 £30 </p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-acbc46773f00fd53bf6b {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-acbc46773f00fd53bf6b .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-acbc46773f00fd53bf6b {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-acbc46773f00fd53bf6b {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-acbc46773f00fd53bf6b {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-acbc46773f00fd53bf6b {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-acbc46773f00fd53bf6b .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  \n  </div>\n  \n</section>\n\n      \n    \n      \n        \n        \n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<section\n  data-test=\"page-section\"\n  \n  data-section-theme=\"black\"\n  class='page-section \n    \n      layout-engine-section\n    \n    background-width--full-bleed\n    \n      \n        section-height--custom\n      \n    \n    \n      content-width--wide\n    \n    horizontal-alignment--center\n    vertical-alignment--top\n    \n      \n    \n    \n    black'\n  \n  data-section-id=\"61a537b52b1c155d9540dd9c\"\n  \n  data-controller=\"SectionWrapperController\"\n  data-current-styles=\"{\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;imageOverlayOpacity&quot;: 0.15,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;backgroundWidth&quot;: &quot;background-width--full-bleed&quot;,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;sectionHeight&quot;: &quot;section-height--custom&quot;,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;customSectionHeight&quot;: 10,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;horizontalAlignment&quot;: &quot;horizontal-alignment--center&quot;,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;verticalAlignment&quot;: &quot;vertical-alignment--top&quot;,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;contentWidth&quot;: &quot;content-width--wide&quot;,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;customContentWidth&quot;: 50,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;sectionTheme&quot;: &quot;black&quot;,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;sectionAnimation&quot;: &quot;none&quot;,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;backgroundMode&quot;: &quot;image&quot;\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          }\"\n  data-current-context=\"{\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;video&quot;: {\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              &quot;playbackSpeed&quot;: 0.5,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              &quot;filter&quot;: 1,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              &quot;filterStrength&quot;: 0,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              &quot;zoom&quot;: 0,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              &quot;videoSourceProvider&quot;: &quot;none&quot;\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            },\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;backgroundImageId&quot;: null,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;backgroundMediaEffect&quot;: null,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;divider&quot;: null,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;typeName&quot;: &quot;page&quot;\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          }\"\n  data-animation=\"none\"\n  \n   \n  \n     style=\"min-height: 10vh;\" \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n  data-sqsp-section=\"classic-editor\"\n\n\n>\n  <div\n    class=\"section-border\"\n    \n  >\n    <div class=\"section-background\">\n    \n      \n    \n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div\n    class='content-wrapper'\n    style='\n      \n        \n           padding-bottom: calc(10vmax / 5);\n        \n      \n    '\n  >\n    <div\n      class=\"content\"\n      \n    >\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-type=\"page-section\" id=\"page-section-61a537b52b1c155d9540dd9c\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block website-component-block sqs-block-website-component sqs-block-html html-block\" data-block-css=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/2328ad91-4a65-4ef8-869d-177344382b88_847/website.components.html.styles.css&quot;]\" data-block-scripts=\"[&quot;https://definitions.sqspcdn.com/website-component-definition/static-assets/website.components.html/2328ad91-4a65-4ef8-869d-177344382b88_847/website.components.html.visitor.js&quot;]\" data-block-type=\"1337\" data-definition-name=\"website.components.html\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" data-website-component-id=\"b4a52e4efde2bd0ab7d7\" id=\"block-b4a52e4efde2bd0ab7d7\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\"><div class=\"sqs-text-block-container\">\n  \n  <div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Proudly the “antithesis of the multiplex”, for more than a decade we have been touring our Time Out featured mobile repertory cinema through Waltham Forest and beyond, showing over <strong>600 </strong>films at <strong>40 </strong>venues to <strong>35,000 </strong>people in the process. </p><p class=\"sqsrte-large\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Started as Stow Film Lounge in 2011 to bring regular commercial screenings back to the Waltham Forest (which at the time was one of only two London Boroughs to have no regular operating cinema) we bought kit, sourced venues and started programming. From Saturday morning kids’ pictures to silent cinema with live orchestra to outdoor screenings to one off cult movie events with Q&amp;As, we deliver diverse bespoke audience screenings but also hit the spot with mainstream blockbusters, both in our home Borough and beyond. </p></div>\n\n\n  \n<style id=\"container-styles\">#block-b4a52e4efde2bd0ab7d7 {\n    \n    --stroke-style: none;--stroke-thickness: 6px;\n    \n      \n      \n      \n    \n\n\n\n  }\n\n  #block-b4a52e4efde2bd0ab7d7 .sqs-html-content {\n    \n    --tweak-text-block-padding: 6% 6% 6% 6%;\n  --tweak-text-block-padding: initial;\n}\n\n  #block-b4a52e4efde2bd0ab7d7 {\n      mix-blend-mode: var(--tweak-text-block-blend\n  );\n      border-radius: var(--tweak-text-block-radius);\n  }\n\n  \n  \n#block-b4a52e4efde2bd0ab7d7 {\n      --tweak-text-block-radius: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\n    }\n\n\n  \n  \n\n  #block-b4a52e4efde2bd0ab7d7 {\n    }\n\n</style>\n\n<style id=\"override-container-styles\">\n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n            \n\n#block-b4a52e4efde2bd0ab7d7 {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  \n    @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          #block-b4a52e4efde2bd0ab7d7 .sqs-html-content {\n            \n            }\n        }\n    \n  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {\n          \n          \n\n          \n          \n          \n        }</style>\n<style class=\"transform-overrides-vars\">\n  \n</style>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  \n  </div>\n  \n</section>\n\n      \n    \n      \n        \n        \n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<section\n  data-test=\"page-section\"\n  \n  data-section-theme=\"black\"\n  class='page-section \n    \n      gallery-section\n      full-bleed-section\n    \n    background-width--full-bleed\n    \n      section-height--medium\n    \n    \n      content-width--wide\n    \n    horizontal-alignment--center\n    vertical-alignment--middle\n    \n      \n    \n    \n    black'\n  \n  data-section-id=\"61fad9db0b3cde60a064cb01\"\n  \n  data-controller=\"SectionWrapperController\"\n  data-current-styles=\"{\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;backgroundWidth&quot;: &quot;background-width--full-bleed&quot;,\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            &quot;imageOverlayOpacity&quot;: 0.15,\n                                                                                                                   